ui,sans-serif;color:#f5c542'><div style='display:flex;gap:1cqw;align-items:baseline'><span style='color:#f5c542;font:800 1.6cqw/1.1 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif'>1</span><span><b style='color:#ffffff'>Each person</b> <span style='font-weight:400;color:#cfe0ff'>is profiled from the pages they publish themselves.</span></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1cqw;align-items:baseline'><span style='color:#f5c542;font:800 1.6cqw/1.1 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif'>2</span><span><b style='color:#ffffff'>The Person Profile</b> <span style='font-weight:400;color:#cfe0ff'>template turns the cards into a page, a card and a face.</span></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1cqw;align-items:baseline'><span style='color:#f5c542;font:800 1.6cqw/1.1 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif'>3</span><span><b style='color:#ffffff'>A fact</b> <span style='font-weight:400;color:#cfe0ff'>that could not be confirmed is marked to check.</span></span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:1cqw;align-items:baseline'><span style='color:#f5c542;font:800 1.6cqw/1.1 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif'>4</span><span><b style='color:#ffffff'>Private details</b> <span style='font-weight:400;color:#cfe0ff'>are left out.</span></span></div><div style='grid-column:1 / -1;margin-top:.6cqw;font:400 1.2cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#f5c542'>Each portal above shows its profile's own card.</div></div><div style='position:absolute;right:4cqw;top:3cqw;display:flex;gap:2.2cqw;font:700 1.9cqw/1.2 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;white-space:nowrap'><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/tutorial/root.node' style='color:#f5c542;text-decoration:none'>Start here →</a><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/library/primitives/root/root.node' style='color:#f5c542;text-decoration:none'>What a graph is →</a><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/root.node' style='color:#f5c542;text-decoration:none'>The Twilite Zone →</a></div></div></div>"
        },
        "memo": "The environment: the room the graph's work sits in. This poster teaches; delete it and the graph stands on plain graph paper."
      }
